## THE SURFACE CHECK (STOP-SEVERITY; Tuesday's commission: "No public member of `src/Datasec.Suite.Secrets/` changes")
- **The program:** `<lane>/gate/surface/` (`Surface.csproj`, `Program.cs`; the drafter's, built OUTSIDE the clone into `<lane>/surface-out`, framework references only, no package). It loads `Datasec.Suite.Secrets.dll` by reflection and prints one line per visible type and per public or protected member (parameter names, defaults, const values, modifiers), sorted, then `SURFACE: <n> lines, sha256 <hex>, Datasec.Suite.Secrets.dll`.
